url: "https://egagli.github.io/global_snow_networks/"
# The concept DOI: it always resolves to the newest Zenodo snapshot. Each
# `v*` release (release-snapshot.yml) gets its own version DOI under it;
# cite that one when a specific snapshot matters (first: v2026.09.22,
# 10.5281/zenodo.22904254).
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22904253
license-url: "https://github.com/egagli/global_snow_networks"
keywords:
